  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l001": "Opening continues Chubak’s complaint from1021; no new speaker supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l011": "Бирди is visibly one; unusual singular spoil count retained rather than silently multiplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l012": "Бил = пил, elephant, explicitly allowed by edition preface15; gold coins loaded on elephants.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l015": "A thousand women as captives is the character’s conquest boast; no consensual gift relationship invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l017": "Urum retained as the epic place-name beside Crimea, without fixing its modern borders.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l027": "Belt about the neck is the pleading/submission gesture; not an attempted hanging.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l030": "Repeated ethnic, religious and servile insults in1022–1029 remain Chubak’s or Almambet’s speech, not translator judgments.",
    "manas-2010:p1022:b001:l035": "Оорук is the army’s rear/camp; baggage train is contextual, edition glossary1841:b001:l039–040.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l006": "Fast Sarala and dog-insult share a compressed row; dog addresses the rider, not a canine horse.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l007": "Sitting/hem imagery in7–8 retained provisionally; exact dress-related idiom uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l009": "Бүрүк = uncircumcised person, edition glossary1836:b001:l002; not mongrel.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l014": "Three hearthstones and blue hearth are the literal household images; no invented ritual explanation.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l017": "Бысмылда rendered In God’s name; insult contradicts Almambet’s asserted conversion, as the dialogue intends.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l028": "Conditional self-curse, not a statement that Almambet has already abandoned his faith.",
    "manas-2010:p1023:b001:l038": "Жаң-жуң is the general’s title, not necessarily a personal name.",
    "manas-2010:p1024:b001:l003": "Printed мен эмес is negative despite Almambet’s detailed subsequent knowledge; contradiction retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1024:b001:l012": "Forty days is the stated desert journey, without modern distance conversion.",
    "manas-2010:p1024:b001:l020": "Кечил rendered monks; exact religious/political grouping not further identified.",
    "manas-2010:p1024:b001:l026": "Capitalized Калча retained as the named warrior here, unlike descriptive калча elsewhere.",
    "manas-2010:p1024:b001:l037": "Image prints жөөсү, footsoldier, beside giant at40; not silently emended to дөөсү.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l010": "Чер is inward sorrow/rancor; split open preserves the violent metaphor.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l015": "Коло is bronze, contextual idol fashioned by hand in14; no modern religious practice inferred.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l017": "Бүрүк uncircumcised, edition1836:l002. Source’s black-bodied insult retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l031": "Калдыр is loud rustling/rattling, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калдыр/. Rustling robe is a provisional clothing epithet; no specific fabric or armor construction asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l034": "God struck Chubak is the calamity/folly formula, not a new literal death at this point.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l035": "Кой көздүү is the brown/sheep-eye epithet; чекир flecks contrasted with freckles in36.",
    "manas-2010:p1025:b001:l040": "Splitting ribs and flames from the mouth are figurative anger descriptions.",
    "manas-2010:p1026:b001:l001": "Жойболот interpreted as battle-steel/weapon; exact weapon type not invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1026:b001:l021": "Dust flying ablaze is the epic battle formula; literal fire in every grain not asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p1026:b001:l023": "Тозгон road-blocking/protective image retained; the exact relation to scouting is compressed.",
    "manas-2010:p1026:b001:l026": "Таш сайынган is wearing cap buttons indicating rank, not stone worship. Established project lexical correction; таза in27 is finest.",
    "manas-2010:p1026:b001:l032": "The road is compared to a prior allotted possession; conditional force contextual.",
    "manas-2010:p1026:b001:l041": "Амызы = намысы and аадан = наадан at42; edition preface15 records dropped initial n.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l007": "Бут here idol, not foot; religious renunciation context.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l018": "Кызырдуу is blessed by Khizir, retaining the named sacred helper.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l024": "Breaking with the homeland is the figurative reading beside the more violent father-killing claims at1029.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l030": "Muslim’s dog retains Almambet’s stated comparison rather than softening his self-abasement.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l034": "Аалы така are metal boot-heel fittings, not the personal name Ali; Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/аа/ gives the exact broad-boot formula.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l036": "Provisional degree reading: Kongurbay was much more a man, contrasting his conduct with Chubak. Алда кайда also means far away; exact comparison remains uncertain. The draft does not assert Kongurbay’s inferiority to Almambet.",
    "manas-2010:p1027:b001:l038": "Бил interpreted in the rule/administer sense in this sovereignty claim, rather than mere acquaintance.",
    "manas-2010:p1028:b001:l006": "Урум interpreted as lineage/offspring, Karasayev урум(тукум), https://el-sozduk.kg/урум/; unlike place-name Urum at1022:17. Possessive relationship contextual.",
    "manas-2010:p1028:b001:l008": "Шуркут = шуркуя, bold/reckless woman or woman of loose conduct, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/shurkut/ and https://el-sozduk.kg/шуркуя/. Bold women chosen in the wives enumeration; formal concubine status unverified.",
    "manas-2010:p1028:b001:l014": "Unable to hold a handful is rendered as the soul unable to hold together; distress idiom.",
    "manas-2010:p1028:b001:l030": "Бириңди read as пириңди, your spiritual guide; edition preface15 records бир-пир. Caliph-sultan is a title, not a modern officeholder.",
    "manas-2010:p1028:b001:l040": "Бириңди again read as пириңди, spiritual guide, beside the sultan in Mecca; exact referent unnamed.",
    "manas-2010:p1029:b001:l015": "Talas boundaries belong to the accusation about territorial power; no new mapped borders asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p1029:b001:l021": "Father-killing is Almambet’s explicit claim, repeated24/27; no harmonization with any alternative narrative.",
    "manas-2010:p1029:b001:l025": "Printed май, fat, beside blood at22 is retained without silent emendation.",
    "manas-2010:p1030:b001:l001": "Removing the right sleeve is freeing the arm for combat, not removing the whole garment.",
    "manas-2010:p1030:b001:l009": "Inability to strike each other is explicit despite the preceding charges; hesitation retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1030:b001:l015": "Lion, tiger and leopard are consecutive epithets for arriving Manas, not three animals.",
    "manas-2010:p1030:b001:l030": "Twins is metaphorical sworn kinship;1031:34 explicitly denies one womb.",
    "manas-2010:p1031:b001:l010": "Канкор rendered lord of battle in the heroic epithet sense, Yudakhin канкорII and Manas encyclopedia https://el-sozduk.kg/канкор/; the word also has a bloodthirsty homonym. Same choice throughout this batch.",
    "manas-2010:p1031:b001:l029": "Lone man on foot is the literal dependency image, not a report that Manas has lost his horse.",
    "manas-2010:p1031:b001:l033": "Куш in predatory context rendered hawk; the swan is the stated victim.",
    "manas-2010:p1031:b001:l036": "Brothers by relationship rather than shared womb; no legal adoption details invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1032:b001:l020": "The action do this remains elliptical, referring to the preceding abandonment accusation.",
    "manas-2010:p1032:b001:l033": "Wild-sheep/copper legs describe the offered horse, not the unmounted companion.",
    "manas-2010:p1032:b001:l039": "Огой = ногой, Nogay, explicitly supported by edition preface15:b002:l005–007.",
    "manas-2010:p1032:b001:l040": "At your feet interpreted as acknowledging authority; exact institutional hierarchy unspecified.",
    "manas-2010:p1033:b001:l005": "Каргыттанып provisionally brandishing/making the spear leap, from каргыт causative jump https://el-sozduk.kg/каргыт/. Expanded/reflexive form and exact handling remain uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p1033:b001:l019": "Кембайлап = under guard, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/кембай/; no chains supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1033:b001:l031": "Repeated if-I-do-not phrases31–39 retain an incomplete oath; its unstated penalty is not invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1033:b001:l035": "Chalyar is a personal name in Karalaev’s telling according to edition glossary1834:l003–013.",
    "manas-2010:p1033:b001:l037": "Мыйзам is autumn gossamer in this exact dry-stalk formula, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/myyzam-6/.",
    "manas-2010:p1034:b001:l021": "Ages eleven, twelve, thirteen and fifteen retained without harmonization with earlier biographical episodes.",
    "manas-2010:p1034:b001:l034": "Guilt falling on the neck remains a metaphor, followed by actual lead-rope submission1035.",
    "manas-2010:p1035:b001:l008": "Pit/brine in8–9 is the surrender/self-curse formula, not an execution that occurs.",
    "manas-2010:p1035:b001:l012": "Image legible; карыдайда not resolved by edition glossary or primary dictionary search. Indexed Kyrgyz parallel PDF direct URL returned404. Entire row excluded from English and word totals; no invented place-name or hardship reading. Completion-first first pass: Best-effort rendering from a close formulaic parallel; retain for specialist review because the source was previously unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p1035:b001:l019": "My dark eyes for sale rendered yours to dispose of in the self-offering; no actual sale price supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1035:b001:l040": "Каканчын rendered Chinese realm in this locative setting; no modern border identification.",
    "manas-2010:p1035:b001:l041": "Take me as companion is Chubak’s request recalled by Almambet; pronoun supplied from the dialogue.",
    "manas-2010:p1036:b001:l006": "Whip round neck parallels Chubak’s lead-rope apology; not self-harm.",
    "manas-2010:p1036:b001:l021": "Star, antelope-hair, kneaded-flour and spring images in21–31 preserved as reconciliation imagery; exact antelope-hair gesture remains unclear.",
    "manas-2010:p1036:b001:l040": "Will not become two is the literal destruction/no-prospering idiom; no specific descendant count inferred.",
    "manas-2010:p1037:b001:l011": "Milk by day/girls by night retained without specifying additional sexual acts.",
    "manas-2010:p1037:b001:l029": "Captive daughters’ weeping is explicit; no euphemistic voluntary travel supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1037:b001:l031": "Жаналы normalized to established personal-name spelling Zhanaaly.",
    "manas-2010:p1038:b001:l004": "Уз is skilled craftswoman; kept alongside silk despite the compressed clothing-gift syntax.",
    "manas-2010:p1038:b001:l031": "Табылгы is meadowsweet/spiraea shrub; valley image is metaphorical praise.",
    "manas-2010:p1038:b001:l037": "Тегизим has unusual possessive form; whole-world force retained provisionally without silently emending to деңизим.",
    "manas-2010:p1038:b001:l038": "Жеткилең = perfect/excellent, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/жеткилең/; splendid city, not distant.",
    "manas-2010:p1039:b001:l003": "Darkness/night threat retained literally; not a verified verbatim repeat of1028, which records only the joint-khan challenge.",
    "manas-2010:p1039:b001:l010": "Making one word two is breaking faith/consistency; the numeric image retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1039:b001:l021": "Even-if-Chinese and even-if-infidel at28 are concessive comparisons about a man with his own people; not a new claim that Chubak is ethnically Chinese.",
    "manas-2010:p1040:b001:l004": "Каргылуу кара тоо = impregnable mountain, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/каргыл/; figuratively dependable protection, not ridged.",
    "manas-2010:p1040:b001:l012": "Була cloth/fiber retained in the theft comparison; the specific goods are not otherwise identified.",
    "manas-2010:p1040:b001:l019": "Аш бышырым is a meal-cooking span, not a fixed number of minutes.",
    "manas-2010:p1040:b001:l024": "Manas’s private conditional thought24–32 ends unfinished before the geographic passage; no completion or actual apostasy supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1041:b001:l003": "Giant black bird and fanged creatures read as separate inhabitants; punctuation permits uncertainty whether fanged modifies the mythic bird.",
    "manas-2010:p1041:b001:l014": "Жон жору = large чүйлү; чүйлүII = male goshawk in Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/zhoru/ and https://el-sozduk.kg/чүйлү/. Not compositional ridge vulture.",
    "manas-2010:p1041:b001:l024": "Knees bending before running retained as printed; precise stance uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p1041:b001:l032": "Умачтай көзү ачылуу is restored clear sight, Yudakhin’s exact eye-opening example https://tamgasoft.kg/dict/d-2/word/умач; not literal dough eyes.",
    "manas-2010:p1041:b001:l036": "Source permits Manas as warrior’s support; following39 explicitly calls him the people’s prop.",
    "manas-2010:p1041:b001:l042": "Final lake-heart simile continues beyond this batch; no invented completion."
  },
